==English==

===Interjection===
'''ohi'''

# A casual greeting exchanged between former players of Quake and EverQuest. When coupled with "pal", it is indicative of friendly intent on the part of the speaker.

----

==Finnish==

===Adverb===
'''ohi'''

# (''temporal'') [[over]]:
#:*Se on '''ohi''' nyt.
#:**It is ''over'' now.

===Postposition===
'''ohi''' (+ ''[[genitive]], shorter form for'' [[ohitse]])

# [[by]], [[past]] (when one goes ''through'' the space that is ''next to'' something):
#:*Pallo pyöri tuolin '''ohi''' ja ovesta ulos.
#:**The ball rolled ''by'' the chair and out of the door.

